Below is a table showing each of our expenses, the category of the expense, and the dollar amount. This is followed by a brief summary.

```{r}
#| warning: false
#| echo: false

y <- read.csv("y.csv")

library(tidyverse, magrittr)

tibble(y)

y %<>%
  mutate(Cost = as.numeric(Cost)) %>% 
  group_by(Type) %>% 
  summarise(tot_c = sum(Cost))

for (i in 1:4) {
  cat("Total Expenses for ", y$Type[i], ": $", y$tot_c[i], "\n")
} 

cat("Total Overall: ", sum(y$tot_c))

cat("Total for just Food/Hotel: ", y$tot_c[1] + y$tot_c[2])

```
